* ''Keep the Lararium first'' (operator, 2026-11-06: //"I don't want to expand scope, tho the secret store reads as very pono to get right."// and //"We can iterate on the secrets vault after the wiki stands, it was improtant to lock the design. Focus on the Lararium as priority."//). `P27` lands before the rite as ruled: the required floor readings, sealed registry and share tightening at four crossings. The vault's store, onboarding, key delivery and recipient lifecycle stand designed in <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/reach-plane`>> and build after the hearth stands, as the first lane the memory stage tracks.

